 ane between SE Belmont St & SE Stark St\, Portland\, OR 97214\nWebsite: ht
 tps://www.peacocklane.org/\nDetails: Since 1932. The homepage and FAQ both
  show the 2026 season - lights December 15-31\, 6-10pm\; pedestrian-only n
 ights December 15-16\; free cocoa booth December 15-24 from 6pm. One homep
 age line says 11pm for opening night\, but the header\, Quick Facts\, and 
 FAQ all say 10pm.
