SUMMARY:Oregon Zoo ZooLights
DESCRIPTION:Category: Events & Festivals\nCost: $13-$35 adults\, $13-$30 yo
 uth depending on the night\; prices and times vary throughout the season. 
 Income-assistance tickets are $13 each.\nNote: Members get 20% off regular
  tickets\, with no additional discounts on Value Nights. Income-assistance
  tickets are $13 each\, up to four per household\, with an Oregon Trail ca
 rd\, Washington Quest card\, OHP/Apple Health\, WIC eWIC card\, or TANF. R
 eserve them through the ZooLights income-assistance link on oregonzoo.org/
 discounts and bring proof of benefits and residency. A ZooLights ticket is
  also a TriMet and Streetcar fare to and from the zoo on your admission da
 te.\nAddress: Oregon Zoo\, 4001 SW Canyon Rd\, Portland\, OR 97221\nPhone:
  503-226-1561\nWebsite: https://www.oregonzoo.org/lights\nDetails: Annual 
 holiday light display at the Oregon Zoo\, November 20\, 2026 through Janua
 ry 3\, 2027 (closed November 24-26 and December 25). Not free\; the lowest
  ticket price is $13 (income-assistance tickets\, up to four per household
 ).
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD HTML 3.2//EN"><HTML><BODY><p><strong>Category:</strong> Events &amp; Festivals</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> $13-$35 adults, $13-$30 youth depending on the night; prices and times vary throughout the season. Income-assistance tickets are $13 each.</p><p><em>Members get 20% off regular tickets, with no additional discounts on Value Nights. Income-assistance tickets are $13 each, up to four per household, with an Oregon Trail card, Washington Quest card, OHP/Apple Health, WIC eWIC card, or TANF. Reserve them through the ZooLights income-assistance link on oregonzoo.org/discounts and bring proof of benefits and residency. A ZooLights ticket is also a TriMet and Streetcar fare to and from the zoo on your admission date.</em></p><p><strong>Address:</strong> Oregon Zoo, 4001 SW Canyon Rd, Portland, OR 97221</p><p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:503-226-1561">503-226-1561</a></p><p><strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://www.oregonzoo.org/lights">https://www.oregonzoo.org/lights</a></p><p><strong>Details:</strong> Annual holiday light display at the Oregon Zoo, November 20, 2026 through January 3, 2027 (closed November 24-26 and December 25). Not free; the lowest ticket price is $13 (income-assistance tickets, up to four per household).</p></BODY></HTML>
X-MICROSOFT-CDO-BUSYSTATUS:FREE
